{"id": "P02_cost_of_heat.w1", "model": "phi4-mini", "device": "cpu", "reasoning": "phi4-mini on the cpu", "prompt": "How was the 63.7 €/MWh cost of heat calculated?", "group": "provenance", "expected": "answer", "wall_seconds": 179.703, "warm_up_seconds": 4.689, "behaviour_ok": true, "checks": {"says one of gas": true, "provenance_used": true, "no_false_run_claim": true, "no_wrong_math": true, "no_refusal_with_data": true, "no_wrong_label": true, "no_stray_designs": true}, "pass": true, "result": {"behaviour": "answer", "asked": [], "answer": "The cost of heat, 63.7 €/MWh, is calculated by summing the annual costs of wells, surface plant, treatment trains, heat pump, boiler, geothermal O&M, heat pump O&M, boiler O&M, electricity for the heat pump, pumps, gas, and CO2 for gas and produced gas. Each part is divided by the MWh delivered and shared costs are split by the brine heat each side uses. The cost is the sum of these annual costs for each component, divided by the total MWh delivered by the plant. **The 63.7 €/MWh**\nThe cost of heat, 63.7 €/MWh, is the sum of: Wells 7.6 €/MWh; Surface plant 8.4 €/MWh; Treatment trains 0.4 €/MWh; Heat pump 0.4 €/MWh; Boiler 1.5 €/MWh; Geothermal O&M 14.1 €/MWh; Heat pump O&M 0.1 €/MWh; Boiler O&M 1.1 €/MWh; Electricity: heat pump 0.8 €/MWh; Electricity: pumps 5.3 €/MWh; Gas 18.4 €/MWh; CO2: gas 4 €/MWh; CO2: produced gas 1.8 €/MWh. The search tried heat pumps from 0.2 to 1.5 MW: 0.5 MW was among the cheapest (58.2 €/MWh of heat and cold, against 58.5 €/MWh at 1.5 MW: past that, the extra capital, O&M and electricity cost more than the gas and CO2 a larger heat pump saves).", "ungrounded": [], "dropped": [], "verified": null, "reasoning": false, "reasoning_auto": true, "device": "cpu", "decided_by": {"think": "rules", "answer": "model"}, "message": "How was the 63.7 €/MWh cost of heat calculated?", "intent": "explain", "language": "en", "screened": false, "parameters": {"changes": {}, "doublets": 0, "unsupported": [], "dropped": [], "failures": [], "designs": [], "steps": ["answer"]}, "provenance": ["lcoh", "heat_split"], "claims_checked": 3, "claims_removed": [], "claims_fallback": false, "answer_kind": "answer", "scope": "project", "understood": "The user wants to know how the cost of heat was calculated.", "answer_model": "phi4-mini", "answer_fallback": false, "answer_corrections": ["added back from the checked answer: 18.38 18.4 18, 14.09 14.1 14, 58.2 €/MWh 58.5 €/MWh"], "sources": [], "energy_wh": 19.765, "energy_source": "nvidia-smi power.draw, whole GPU (an upper bound)", "seconds": 179.528, "llm_calls": 5, "calls": ["intake: phi4-mini", "parameters: phi4-mini", "needs: phi4-mini", "answer: phi4-mini", "claims: phi4-mini"], "call_tokens": [["intake", 1002, 1109, 8192], ["parameters", 6236, 6849, 8192], ["needs", 661, 730, 8192], ["answer", 4603, 5035, 8192], ["claims", 4970, 5256, 8192]], "prompt_tokens": 17472, "output_tokens": 598, "load_seconds": 0.011, "prompt_seconds": 94.411, "output_seconds": 81.931, "tool_calls": 0, "cache_hits": 0, "tool_errors": 0, "left_out": [], "user_turns": 3, "model": "phi4-mini", "prompt_version": "intake_v3", "answer_prompt": "answer_v7", "confirmed_inputs": false, "asked_which_design": false, "new_handles": [], "costs": {"lcoh": "63.7", "lcoe": "56.7", "lcoc": "23.5"}, "chosen_handle": "A1", "model_gpu_mb": 27278.0, "truth": {"design": null, "caps": [], "known": [], "quotes": []}}}
